<p>That doesn't make any sense though, being in an area has no inherent memetic content. Location isn't information. Information about a location is, but merely &quot;You are at such and such a place&quot; seems to be too sparse a message to be a carrier for &quot;and you can't leave it without loss of personal property or social status&quot;.</p>
